/// **A gap in ECMA-376, not in this workspace.** The file has no element for these, so
/// there is nothing to extract and inventing a path would be exactly the guess the naming
/// rule forbids elsewhere. [`definition_of`](crate::definition_of) answers `None` for each,
/// which is the answer that reaches
/// [`UnknownShapePolicy`](crate::UnknownShapePolicy) — an error, or a counted stand-in.
